<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Cs161 on hengyu</title><link>https://hengyuss.github.io/tags/cs161/</link><description>Recent content in Cs161 on hengyu</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-cn</language><copyright>Example Person</copyright><lastBuildDate>Fri, 04 Jul 2025 11:58:40 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://hengyuss.github.io/tags/cs161/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Day1</title><link>https://hengyuss.github.io/p/day1/</link><pubDate>Fri, 04 Jul 2025 11:58:40 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://hengyuss.github.io/p/day1/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="cs161-概述">cs161 概述
&lt;/h1>&lt;p>cs161是伯克利大学开设的一门关于计算机安全的课程，其中涉及了如何设计一个安全的软件系统，内存安全，密码学，网络安全等多方面内容，出于研究生所选方向与安全有关，所以我希望我能在一个月内完成这门课的学习，包括lab,project,homework等代码编写，我会将其代码上传到我个人的git仓库中,并依此系列作为我的学习笔记，一个月后提交给导师。&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="cs61c-内容回顾">cs61c 内容回顾
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>我的学习进度还没有到cs61c，对于cs61c的完整知识体系还不熟悉。但是今天的课程是关于cs61c的一个复习，如果课中提到的cs61c中的内容能够听懂的话，还是可以继续进行下去这个课的。&lt;/p>
&lt;h3 id="x86汇编">x86汇编
&lt;/h3>&lt;h4 id="语法格式">语法格式
&lt;/h4>
&lt;div class="mermaid" align="left">
flowchart TD
classDef common fill:#f43,stroke:#333,color:#ffffffff
A[opcode]:::common
B[source]:::common
C[detination]:::common
&lt;/div>
&lt;h4 id="c函数调用过程">C函数调用过程
&lt;/h4>&lt;p>函数调用过程几个重要的寄存器&lt;/p>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>epb 存储栈顶信息&lt;/li>
&lt;li>esp 存储栈低信息&lt;/li>
&lt;li>eip 存储下一条待执行指令的内存地址&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">2
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">3
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">4
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">5
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">6
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">7
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">8
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">9
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-C" data-lang="C">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kt">void&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">caller&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(){&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nf">callee&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">1&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">2&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">);&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">callee&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">a&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">b&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">){&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">local&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">42&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>对应的汇编代码&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt"> 1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 2
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 3
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 4
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 5
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 6
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 7
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 8
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 9
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">10
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">11
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">12
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">13
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">14
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-asm" data-lang="asm">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nl">caller:&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nf">push&lt;/span> &lt;span class="no">$2&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nf">push&lt;/span> &lt;span class="no">$1&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nf">call&lt;/span> &lt;span class="no">callee&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nf">add&lt;/span> &lt;span class="no">$8&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nv">%esp&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nl">callee:&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nf">push&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nv">%ebp&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nf">mov&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nv">%esp&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nv">%ebp&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nf">sub&lt;/span> &lt;span class="no">$4&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nv">%esp&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nf">mov&lt;/span> &lt;span class="no">$42&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="no">$eax&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nf">mov&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nv">%ebp&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nv">%esp&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nf">pop&lt;/span> &lt;span class="no">$ebp&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nf">ret&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>以上述代码为例子&lt;/p>
&lt;p>
&lt;div class="mermaid" align="left">
flowchart LR
subgraph caller_stack_frame ["function stack memory graph"]
direction TB
A[caller stack frame]
B[ ]
C[ ]
D[ ]
E[ ]
end
EBP((("EBP"))) --> A
ESP((("ESP"))) --> A
style caller_stack_frame #stroke:#333
style EBP stroke:#222
style ESP stroke:#222`
&lt;/div>
初始位置时esp和ebp指向同一地址,随后caller函数将立即数1,2压入栈中，esp作为栈低向下生长，此时eip指向call callee即即将开始调用callee&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="mermaid" align="left">
flowchart LR
subgraph caller_stack_frame ["function stack memory graph"]
direction TB
A[caller stack frame]
B[1]
C[2]
D[ ]
E[ ]
end
EBP((("EBP"))) --> A
ESP((("ESP"))) --> C
style caller_stack_frame #stroke:#333
style EBP stroke:#222
style ESP stroke:#222`
&lt;/div>
&lt;p>随后进入调用callee的过程中,此时要为callee函数申请新的o栈,在此之前要保存之前eip将要执行的代码的地址，执行完call callee进入调用callee函数，那么返回后的地址就应该是add $8, %esp(参考上述caller中的汇编代码),这个地址也保存在栈中，即将add &amp;amp;8, %esp这段代码的地址压入栈中，方便从callee函数返回后，cpu知道从哪继续执行。&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="mermaid" align="left">
flowchart LR
subgraph caller_stack_frame ["function stack memory graph"]
direction TB
A[caller stack frame]
B[1]
C[2]
D[address of add $8, %esp]
E[ ]
end
EBP((("EBP"))) --> A
ESP((("ESP"))) --> D
D --> address((("add $8, %esp")))
style caller_stack_frame #stroke:#333
style EBP stroke:#222
style ESP stroke:#222`
&lt;/div>
&lt;p>接下来要将原来的栈顶地址入栈，因为接下来的栈就是callee的栈了
&lt;div class="mermaid" align="left">
flowchart LR
subgraph caller_stack_frame ["function stack memory graph"]
direction TB
A[caller stack frame]
B[1]
C[2]
D[address of add $8, %esp]
E[address of caller stack frame ]
end
direction TB
EBP((("EBP"))) --> ESP((("ESP"))) -->E
D --> address1((("add $8, %esp")))
style caller_stack_frame #stroke:#333
style EBP stroke:#222
style ESP stroke:#222`
&lt;/div>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>在执行callee的过程和caller类似，这里我们主要说执行callee后的返回过程.在callee中可以看到 pop %ebp，是将栈低 caller stack frame的地址也就是原来caller的栈顶地址弹入到ebp中，然后此时esp就指向了address of add %8, %esp&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="mermaid" align="left">
flowchart LR
subgraph caller_stack_frame ["function stack memory graph"]
direction TB
A[caller stack frame]
B[1]
C[2]
D[address of add $8, %esp]
E[ ]
end
direction TB
EBP((("EBP"))) --> A
ESP((("ESP"))) --> D
D --> address1((("add $8, %esp")))
style caller_stack_frame #stroke:#333
style EBP stroke:#222
style ESP stroke:#222`
&lt;/div>
&lt;p>在然后执行ret 汇编代码，将esp所指向的内存地址弹入到eip中也就是add $8, %esp这条命令,cpu 开始从这条命令执行，这条命令的意思就是将esp向上再升两个刚好跨过两个参数1,2的内存地址，epb=esp此时栈就被释放了。(为什么是add $8, %esl, 因为我们说的是32位的系统，每个内存地址是32位也就是4个字节，1,2两个参数分别占一个内存地址因此是两个内存地址也就是8个字节)
&lt;div class="mermaid" align="left">
flowchart LR
subgraph caller_stack_frame ["function stack memory graph"]
direction TB
A[ ]
B[ ]
C[ ]
D[ ]
E[ ]
end
direction TB
EBP((("EBP"))) --> ESP((("ESP"))) -->
D --> address1((("add $8, %esp")))
style caller_stack_frame #stroke:#333
style EBP stroke:#222
style ESP stroke:#222`
&lt;/div>&lt;/p>
&lt;h3 id="额外知识">额外知识
&lt;/h3>&lt;p>在写博客的途中学到的知识&lt;/p>
&lt;h4 id="hugo集成mermaid">hugo集成mermaid
&lt;/h4>&lt;p>我使用的是hugo-theme-stack主题，如果要使用mermaid，我在网上找了很多方法，其中比较有用的是在shortcode目录下添加mermaid.html文件&lt;/p>
